y></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn2-ehp-117-1116"><p>Endo, endotoxin. The amount of endotoxin was equal to that in the PM samples.</p></fn><fn id="tfn3-ehp-117-1116"><p>BAL fluid was obtained from the same mice as those in <xref ref-type="fig" rid="f6-ehp-117-1116">Figure 6</xref>. All cytokine concentrations were in picograms per milliliter .</p></fn><fn id="tfn4-ehp-117-1116"><label>*</label><p><italic>p</italic> &#x0003c; 0.05 compared with control and OVA.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>